ernal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a056f6-90dc-7e42-8a45-5ef0fa817abe","create_time":1788165394.6780753,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a056f7-be3f-7c61-aa33-4b1c2e4a7cf4","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"cta를 5로 높이면 손해가 있어?\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a056f7-be2b-71e1-831f-8590504d43a9","create_time":1788165471.807778,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a056f8-f5d9-7943-81e4-1b9d0ac471b9","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"128 개선도 비슷한 느낌으로 더 가능한가?\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a056f8-f5c3-7bb1-be84-72753f7fd8f2","create_time":1788165551.5774238,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a056f9-b682-7ad3-9832-75e6bed1e9b4","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"진행해줘. 하는김에 64도 5cta 하는걸로 한번 해봐\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a056f9-b66e-7300-898d-7d4e65cdc665","create_time":1788165600.8984416,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05705-e34b-7282-8683-3f3b386fc006","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"좋다. 이제 scripts/offline/run\\_performance\\_suite.sh 기반으로 기존 cao\\_p4flat, cao\\_p4flat-kvcomp 과 비교하려고 하는데 실험 진행해줘. flexgen이나 cao zipserv 류는 굳이 안해도 될 것 같아\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05705-e332-7b21-bd48-89d3b9b6cae0","create_time":1788166398.7952178,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05707-9555-7760-b7d6-36c3f0e8d9e0","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"엥 있는데? remote git repo에는 있는데 왜 여긴 없다는거야. \n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05707-953f-7740-b541-b3122741c3a1","create_time":1788166509.9091346,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05708-d1e0-7d72-8675-b41a0ed30d5e","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text"